<title>USA: Renters Choice CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Renters Choice CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renters Choice Inc said on Thursday David Real, chief financial officer and senior vice president of finance, had resigned effective November 27 to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>He will be replaced by Randall Simpson, who served as controller of the company since October 1995, effective immediately, Renters Choice said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
